<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch govt has no comment on Fokker/Samsung deal.</title>
<headline>Dutch govt has no comment on Fokker/Samsung deal.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch government on Friday said it had no comment on news from Samsung Aerospace that the government wanted an input of $500-600 million from the South Korean company to acquire plane maker Fokker.</p>
<p>&quot;We are making no announcements on this,&quot; Luuc van Zijp, spokesman for Economics Ministry told Reuters.</p>
<p>He added that as far as he was aware, there were no press conferences planned for today on the Fokker takeover.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the Fokker receivers was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
